{"id":"G0129","lemma":"αἷμα","transliteration":"ahima","sayIt":"ahima","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, neuter","gloss":"blood","meaning":"αἷμα, ατος, τό,\n[in LXX for דָּם ;]\nblood.\n1. In the ordinary sense: Mrk.5:25, Luk.8:43,44 22:44, Jhn.19:34, Act.15:20,29 21:25, Rev.8:7,8 11:6 16:3,4,6 19:13.\n2. In special senses:\n(a) of generation, origin, kinship (cl.): Jhn.1:13 (see MM, VGT, see word);\n(b) as in OT (AR on Eph, l.with), in the phrase σάρξ καὶ αἷ. (αἷ. κ. σ.), to indicate human nature as opposite to God and created spirits: Mat.16:17, 1Co.15:50, Gal.1:16, Eph.6:12, Heb.2:14;\n(with) of things in colour resembling blood: Act.2:19,20, Rev.6:12 14:18-20.\n(d) of bloodshed, a bloody death (cl.): Mat.23:30,35 27:4,6,8,24,25, Luk.11:50,51 13:1, Act.1:19 5:28 18:6 20:26 22:20, Heb.12:4, Rev.6:10 17:6 18:24 19:2 ; αἷ. ἐκχέειν (Deiss., LAE, 428; MM, VGT, see word, αἷ.), Rom.3:15, Rev.16:6;\n(e) of sacrificial blood, as an expiation: Heb.9:7,12,13,18-22,25 10:4 11:28 13:11; of the blood of Christ, Mat.26:28, Mrk.14:24, Luk.22:20, Jhn.6:53,54,56, Act.20:28, Rom.3:25 5:9, 1Co.10:16 11:25,27, Eph.1:7 2:13, Col.1:20, Heb.9:12,14 10:19,29 12:24 13:20, 1Pe.1:2,19, 1Jn.1:7 (cf. 5:6,8), Rev.1:5 5:9 7:14 12:11. (Cremer, 69 f., 612 f.)\n† (AS)","glosses":["blood","bleeding","shedding your blood","blood—and these three","blood red"],"count":90,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-16","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"the blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Blood","kjv":"of blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"blood","kjv":"the blood"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":25,"rendering